  "section": {
   "page": "─── Feedback",
   "label": "Feedback"
  },
  "description": {
   "text": "# Purpose\nCommunicates a system-level status message that requires user awareness or a follow-up action. Used at page or section scope — **not tied to a single field or inline element**.\n\n# Use when\n- A system event (error, warning, success, or informational notice) applies to the entire page or a major section\n- The message includes a primary action (e.g. retry, undo) or a dismiss control\n- Feedback must be prominently visible and not buried within content\n\n# Don't use when\n- The message is contextual to a specific row, record, or inline element — use `InlineAlert` instead\n- The status is a passive label that doesn't need user acknowledgment\n\n# Content guidelines\n- **Title:** one short phrase; 60 characters max; sentence case\n- **Body:** expand on the title only when the cause or resolution is non-obvious; omit if the title is self-explanatory\n- **Action label:** 1–3 words; use a verb (\"Retry\", \"View details\"); never \"Click here\"\n- Dismiss is optional — include only when the user should be able to clear the message manually\n\n# Related\n- Use `InlineAlert` instead when the message is scoped to a specific piece of inline content rather than the whole page or section",
   "source": "description",
   "empty": false
  },
